# =============================================================================
# GOOSKY_S1_V3_PRO.otx  —  EdgeTX Companion model descriptor (TEMPLATE)
# =============================================================================
#
# HONEST FORMAT NOTE — PLEASE READ
# --------------------------------
# A genuine binary EdgeTX/OpenTX ".otx" (Companion radio/model container) is a
# packed binary and CANNOT be authored reliably by hand offline. Rather than
# ship a fake/corrupt binary, this file is provided as a HUMAN-READABLE model
# descriptor that mirrors the authoritative model definition.
#
# AUTHORITATIVE, IMPORTABLE FILE:
#     /models/GOOSKY_S1_V3_PRO_ELRS.yml   (EdgeTX on-radio model YAML)
#
# HOW TO USE THIS MODEL
#   Option A (recommended): Open EdgeTX Companion 2.10+, create/import the model
#     from GOOSKY_S1_V3_PRO_ELRS.yml, review EVERY page, then write to the radio
#     and "Save As..." a real .otx/.etx from Companion if you want a binary copy.
#   Option B: On the radio's SD card, copy GOOSKY_S1_V3_PRO_ELRS.yml into /MODELS
#     as the next modelNN.yml and add it to MODELS.TXT (see /sdcard-layout).
#
#  ⚠️  TEMPLATE — NOT FLIGHT-VALIDATED. Every flight-critical value is a
#      placeholder marked "TBD - Verification Required". Resolve them all from
#      the official GooSky manual + GOOSKY app and BENCH-TEST (blades off)
#      before flying. See /docs/safety-checklist.md.
#
# =============================================================================
# MODEL OVERVIEW (mirror of the .yml — see that file for exact mix logic)
# =============================================================================
Model name ........ GOOSKY S1
Radio ............. RadioMaster TX15 Max (EdgeTX 3.0.0+), Mode 2
RF ................ Internal ExpressLRS (CRSF), 8ch full-resolution, 333 Hz
Bitmap ............ GOOSKY.bmp (purple)
Swash type ........ NONE  (flybarless GTS mixes its own swash) [VERIFIED principle]
Channel order ..... AETR + CH5 stability + CH6 collective [REPORTED — verify]

Channels
  CH1  Aileron .................................... [REPORTED]
  CH2  Elevator ........... reverse? ............... TBD - Verification Required
  CH3  Throttle -> head speed ....................... Mild 60% / Wild 70% [VERIFIED p.21]
  CH4  Rudder ...................................... [REPORTED]
  CH5  Stability: Pose(self-level) <-> Manual(3D) .. [VERIFIED p.27]; endpoint µs TBD
  CH6  Collective pitch ............................ degrees [VERIFIED p.21]

Flight modes (SA) -> official GOOSKY modes (manual p.21)
  EASY = General/Normal  pitch +11.5..-2.4deg, governor % TBD
  MILD = IDLE 1          throttle flat 60%, pitch +/-11.5deg
  WILD = IDLE 2          throttle flat 70%, pitch +/-11.5deg
  Stability Pose/Manual on CH5 is independent — see /docs/flight-modes.md

Safety
  Throttle Hold ..... SF (default HOLD), throttle-state warning at power-on
  Failsafe .......... motor-off on link loss — method TBD (see /docs/elrs-setup.md)
  Lua tool .......... read-only; never arms or changes flight-critical settings

Timers
  T1 FLIGHT ......... throttle-run countdown; alarm 4:30 PLACEHOLDER (TBD)
  T2 PWRON .......... optional power-on timer

